            "text": "{\"title\":\"Vietnamese Braised Pork Belly with Fermented Shrimp Paste and Coconut Water\",\"readyInMinutes\":55,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This comforting \u003cb\u003eVietnamese braised pork belly stew\u003c/b\u003e highlights the deep umami complexity of traditional \u003cb\u003efermented shrimp paste\u003c/b\u003e, a staple ingredient in central Vietnamese cookery. Succulent pieces of pork belly are slowly simmered alongside tender eggplant in a fragrant braising liquid infused with fresh \u003cb\u003elemongrass\u003c/b\u003e, garlic, shallots, and sweet coconut water. The distinct savory punch of the fermented paste is balanced by the natural sweetness of coconut juice and rich caramel sauce, producing a dark, glossy, and highly aromatic sauce that coats every morsel. Historically served during cooler weather alongside steaming hot jasmine rice, this traditional stew delivers a robust balance of salty, sweet, pungent, and spicy notes. Preparing the stew involves an initial blanching technique to clarify the meat before braising, ensuring a refined presentation and melt-in-your-mouth texture. Enjoy this heart-warming dish with a side of fresh cucumber slices, herbs, and steamed green vegetables to complement the rich stew gravy.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":480,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":24},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":32,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":49},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":11,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":55},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":14,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":5},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":8,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":9},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":28,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":56},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":85,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":28},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":1120,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":49},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":3,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":12},{\"name\":\"Vitamin A\",\"amount\":450,\"unit\":\"IU\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":9},{\"name\":\"Vitamin C\",\"amount\":12,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":13},{\"name\":\"Calcium\",\"amount\":85,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":9},{\"name\":\"Iron\",\"amount\":3.2,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":18},{\"name\":\"Potassium\",\"amount\":520,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":15},{\"name\":\"Vitamin D\",\"amount\":0.4,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":2},{\"name\":\"Vitamin E\",\"amount\":1.8,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":12},{\"name\":\"Vitamin K\",\"amount\":14,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":12},{\"name\":\"Thiamin\",\"amount\":0.45,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":38},{\"name\":\"Riboflavin\",\"amount\":0.28,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":22},{\"name\":\"Niacin\",\"amount\":5.8,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":36},{\"name\":\"Vitamin B6\",\"amount\":0.42,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":25},{\"name\":\"Folate\",\"amount\":24,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6},{\"name\":\"Vitamin B12\",\"amount\":0.9,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":38},{\"name\":\"Phosphorus\",\"amount\":310,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":31},{\"name\":\"Magnesium\",\"amount\":45,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":11},{\"name\":\"Zinc\",\"amount\":3.8,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":35},{\"name\":\"Selenium\",\"amount\":26,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":47},{\"name\":\"Copper\",\"amount\":0.22,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":24},{\"name\":\"Manganese\",\"amount\":0.35,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":15},{\"name\":\"Choline\",\"amount\":72,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":13},{\"name\":\"Iodine\",\"amount\":12,\"unit\":\"µg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":8},{\"name\":\"Pantothenic Acid\",\"amount\":0.85,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":17}]},\"extendedIngredients\":[{\"amount\":600,\"unit\":\"g\",\"name\":\"pork belly\"},{\"amount\":2,\"unit\":\"tbsp\",\"name\":\"fermented fine shrimp paste\"},{\"amount\":3,\"unit\":\"stalks\",\"name\":\"fresh lemongrass\"},{\"amount\":1,\"unit\":\"cup\",\"name\":\"fresh coconut water\"},{\"amount\":4,\"unit\":\"cloves\",\"name\":\"garlic\"},{\"amount\":2,\"unit\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"shallots\"},{\"amount\":2,\"unit\":\"tbsp\",\"name\":\"fish sauce\"},{\"amount\":1,\"unit\":\"tbsp\",\"name\":\"caramel sauce\"},{\"amount\":2,\"unit\":\"pc\",\"name\":\"thai bird eye chilies\"},{\"amount\":200,\"unit\":\"g\",\"name\":\"eggplant\"},{\"amount\":1,\"unit\":\"tbsp\",\"name\":\"vegetable oil\"}],\"analyzedInstructions\":[{\"name\":\"Main Cooking Phase\",\"steps\":[{\"number\":1,\"step\":\"Cut the pork belly into bite-sized pieces and blanch in boiling water for two minutes to remove impurities, then drain thoroughly.\"},{\"number\":2,\"step\":\"Mince the lemongrass, garlic, shallots, and chilies finely, then combine them in a bowl with the rich fermented fine shrimp paste.\"},{\"number\":3,\"step\":\"Heat vegetable oil in a heavy pot over medium heat, then saute the minced aromatics until fragrant and lightly golden brown.\"},{\"number\":4,\"step\":\"Add the blanched pork belly pieces to the pot, stirring well to coat each piece evenly with the aromatic fermented paste mixture.\"},{\"number\":5,\"step\":\"Pour in the coconut water, caramel sauce, and fish sauce, then bring the liquid to a gentle simmer over medium-low heat.\"},{\"number\":6,\"step\":\"Add cubed eggplant and braise uncovered for thirty minutes until the sauce thickens and the pork becomes tender and succulent.\"}]}]}",
